      "message": "test: characterize disabled wallet settings\n\nWallet startup-setting writes throw when dynamic settings are disabled.\nThe RPC calls report an error even though the wallet state has changed.\n\nCover both the exception and the RPC results before changing this behavior.\nAlso check wallet usability, unchanged settings, and restart behavior.",
